WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
My name is Nim Dolma Dukpa. I am from Paspati Nagar. I have studied here for the first time.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
I like this school. Our director and principal are good.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Teachers and friends are also good.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Our school is very good. I have been studying here since class 2.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
All the students here are talented and multi-talented. Thank you.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
What do I say about my school? Our director sir is very good.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Principal ma'am. Our school doesn't give pressure only in studies.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.000
We have a nice classroom.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Teachers are also cooperative.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Classrooms and washrooms are clean.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:03.000
And here...

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Thank you.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:09.000
We have safety and security guards at our school.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:13.000
We have a 47 cameras with audio.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.000
We are safe in that.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:18.000
We have CCTV cameras in all corridors.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.000
We can hear voices.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.000
Our safety room is good.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.000
We have CCTV cameras in all rooms.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.000
Our directors can watch us.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.000
We are safe in that. Thank you.
